flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Submit a leave request]
    B --> C{Enough days left?}
    C -->|Yes| D[Manager approves]
    C -->|No| E[Decline the request]
    D --> F[(HR records)]
    D --> G[/Notify the employee/]
    F --> H{{Plan the absence}}
    G --> H
    H -.-> B
    E --> I((End))
    H --> I
